{"seq":1,"slug":"vpc-fundamentals","title":"VPC 基础设施","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/vpc-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vpc-subnet-design","title":"VPC 与子网设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/vpc-fundamentals/vpc-subnet-design","wordCount":1513,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"routing-tables-gateways","title":"路由表与网关","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/vpc-fundamentals/routing-tables-gateways","wordCount":1697,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"security-groups-nacl","title":"安全组与网络 ACL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/cloud-networking-vpc-design/vpc-fundamentals/security-groups-nacl","wordCount":1712,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"vpc-基础设施\">VPC 基础设施</h1><p>VPC 是云环境中的逻辑隔离网络单元，是所有云资源部署的容器。本章从 VPC 内部的三个核心构建块出发——子网拓扑设计、路由表与网关配置、安全组与网络 ACL——构建完整的单 VPC 网络模型。</p>\n<p>三篇文档形成递进关系：首先通过子网设计确定地址空间的划分策略和可用区分布；然后用路由表把流量导向正确的网关出口；最后用安全组和 NACL 在实例级和子网级施加访问控制。这三层共同构成了 VPC 内部的&quot;地址—路径—策略&quot;三元模型。</p>\n<p>掌握本章内容后，你将能够为一个中等规模的生产环境设计出可扩展、多可用区冗余、且安全分层清晰的 VPC 架构。</p>\n"}